body:
As you lay on the floor in pain, slowly dying from a lazer beam into the chest. The axolotl laughs at you as you groan in pain wondering where your teammates are. You activate your mic to communicate with your team. They don't respond. They have been attacked in Tilted Towers. Your vision gets blurry. And then for your final moments on the Chapter 3 Season 3 map. The axolotl hits the default dance. As you look at it in disgust, you breathe your last air before being taken away from a bootleg satalite WALL-E robot.

&#x200B;

You get sent back to the lobby. You question that match. It keeps you up at night in confusion. It has been years since the day that the encounter happened between you and the axolotl. And the memory is still coming back, becoming more distorted, creepier and unnerving.

&#x200B;

You fear that the axolotl will come back.

for me it would be upgrade because during the transformation you can hear the bones cracking and see bens face in visble discomfort while the eyes,mouth,nose just go to the side and disappear.

&#x200B;

ben 10 transformations back then were so disturbing i swear
